# scenario: no-saving
# Saving on this computer: listed after the hardware wallet with its warning,
# no device to connect, and no claim that the device shows the address.
click Saving
expect Connect a hardware wallet or use this computer
click Set up
expect Ledger Nano S+
expect Keys stay on this computer. A hardware wallet is safer for large amounts.
shot setup
click This computer
expect Saving is set up
expect This computer
expect-not Not connected
shot saving
click Receive
expect bc1qdemo
expect Coins received this way are marked unmixed
expect-not Your device cannot display this address
shot receive
close-dialog
action app.settings
expect Saving wallet
expect Keys stay on this computer
shot settings
